# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Compiled output
out/
dist/
*.vsix

# Build artifacts
*.js.map

# Environment & secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# VS Code extension packaging
*.vsix

# Databases
*.db
*.sqlite

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# graphify knowledge graph (generated, not source)
graphify-out/

# Agent/skill tooling — local developer tooling, never part of the product.
# Directory rules, because the *.md denylist below cannot reach a nested
# SKILL.md once its directory has been added.
.agents/
.claude/skills/
.claude/agents/

# Notes & data — denylist, NOT a by-name list. Every new strategy/outreach file
# would otherwise ship silently: devcut_outreach_devs.csv leaked real developers'
# private email addresses into the 0.1.4 package before this rule existed.
# Only README.md ships (it is the extension's description page).
#
# NOTE: these rules only affect UNTRACKED files. Anything already committed keeps
# being tracked until `git rm --cached <file>` removes it from the index — which is
# why INDIA-STRATEGY.md, idea.md, issues.md, SCALE-PLAN.md and the .claude/skills
# markdown had to be untracked explicitly rather than just listed here.
*.md
!README.md
*.csv
*.tsv
*.json
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.bmp
*.tiff
*.ico
*.webp
*.svg
*.pdf
*.docx
!package.json